        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na namea, Kwĩanana na ũtonyi witũ ithyĩ nĩtwovoetye ana‐a‐ĩthe maitũ Ayuti, ala mathooew’e i mbaĩ; nenyu nĩmũkwĩtĩkĩla kũmathoosya o na ana‐a‐ĩthe menyu, nao nĩmaĩle ũthooew’a ithyĩ? Na ĩndĩ mavindya ki, na matyaaona ndeto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
